### 2. `src/henchman/metrics/exporter.py` (4 methods)
- **Issues**: All methods with `**filters` parameters were flagged as having undocumented `filters`
- **Fix**: Changed documentation from `**filters:` to `filters:` (without `**`) and added clarification "(keyword arguments)" to indicate these are `**kwargs`-style parameters
